---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const breadcrumb = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://teatrojuarez.com/en/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Tickets', item: 'https://teatrojuarez.com/en/boletos/' }
  ]
};
const faq = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Where can I buy tickets for the Teatro Juárez?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Tickets for performances and, where applicable, guided tours are handled through the venue’s official channels and the Instituto Estatal de la Cultura de Guanajuato. This guide does not sell or distribute tickets.'
      }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'How much do tickets cost?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Prices depend on each event or visit type. Check the exact cost through the official source before buying.'
      }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Is there online ticket sales?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'We recommend buying your tickets always through the official channel to avoid intermediaries and resale. We are not a ticket outlet.'
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/boletos/"
  title="Teatro Juárez Guanajuato tickets & entry"
  description="How to get tickets for performances and visits at the Teatro Juárez. Official channels and tips to avoid resale."
>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumb)} />
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faq)} />

  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="section-label">Practical information</div><h1>Teatro Juárez tickets</h1></div></section>
  <article class="prose">
    <p>The Teatro Juárez is a performing-arts venue with a live program, so how you get in depends on each performance or guided visit.</p>

    <h2>Where to buy your tickets</h2>
    <p>Tickets for performances and, where applicable, guided tours are handled through the <strong>venue’s official channels</strong> and the <strong>Instituto Estatal de la Cultura de Guanajuato</strong>. This guide is informational and <strong>does not sell or distribute tickets</strong>.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://cultura.guanajuato.gob.mx/index.php/teatro-juarez/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cultura Guanajuato · Teatro Juárez ↗</a></li>
      <li><a href="tel:+524737322521">+52 473 732 2521</a> (venue)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="notice">Prices depend on each event or visit type. Always buy through the official channel to avoid intermediaries and resale.</div>

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="faq-item"><h3>Where can I buy tickets for the Teatro Juárez?</h3><p>Tickets for performances and, where applicable, guided tours are handled through the venue’s official channels and the Instituto Estatal de la Cultura de Guanajuato. This guide does not sell or distribute tickets.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h3>How much do tickets cost?</h3><p>Prices depend on each event or visit type. Check the exact cost through the official source before buying.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h3>Is there online ticket sales?</h3><p>We recommend buying your tickets always through the official channel to avoid intermediaries and resale. We are not a ticket outlet.</p></div>
    </div>

    <nav class="related" aria-label="Related pages">
      <a href="/en/horarios/">Hours →</a>
      <a href="/en/cartelera/">Event program →</a>
      <a href="/en/">Teatro Juárez guide →</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
